# Complexity
- Time complexity: $$O(n)$$

- Space complexity: $$O(n)$$

# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public void rotate(int[] nums, int k) {
        if (k == 0) {
            return;
        }
        k = k % nums.length;

        int[] arr = new int[nums.length];
        int size = 0;

        for (int i = nums.length - k; i < nums.length; i++) {
            arr[size++] = nums[i];
        }

        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length - k; i++) {
            arr[size++] = nums[i];
        }

        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
            nums[i] = arr[i];
        }
    }
}
```
